# docs/20 B6 regression (U9, U17, U22; from the review's refute_wordwrap, refute_glossary2,
# s01_spawn_cancel and refute-fm09-menu). Before: the confirm card said "Enter 开始" while its
# hint bar said "Enter 确认", and "` 取消" threw the draft away; the editor cut words in two
# ("Bingo shots o / n Friday"); a selected 说明 row in the Tab menu was a caramel row like
# any key. Now: card and bar say one verb, keycaps on the card, "` 返回修改" over a draft and
# "` 取消" over a queue item; the editor wraps at spaces; a selected 说明 row stays a quiet
# Select capsule with its Raised key, and Enter on it says how to press it.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 3000
press g0
type remember to book the Bingo shots on Friday at the vet and ask about the flea meds too
shot editor-wrap  the editor wraps at spaces
press `
wait 500
press enter
press opt+1
press opt+s
type write e2e test for refunds
press enter
wait 500
shot confirm-spawn  a new session: one verb on card and bar, ` 返回修改
press `
shot back-to-draft  ` goes back to the draft (D6)
press `
wait 500
press enter
press /
press down
press enter
wait 500
shot confirm-item  a queue item: no draft behind it, ` 取消
usb off
wait 2000
shot item-offline  unplugged with the box open: Enter 关闭
press `
press opt+1
press opt+s
type write e2e test for refunds
press enter
wait 500
shot spawn-offline  offline: Enter 存为排队, ` 返回修改
press `
press `
wait 500
press enter
press opt+h
press tab
wait 300
press down down down down down down down down
wait 300
shot menu-explain  a selected 说明 row (1-9): a quiet capsule, not caramel
press enter
wait 300
shot menu-explain-enter  Enter on it: how to press it
press up
wait 300
shot menu-key  a selected key row: caramel as before
